00:00:31.632 --> 00:00:36.246
Dying a child

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:43.176
Oh, Child prey

00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:51.711
Oh, Child prey

00:00:53.854 --> 00:01:01.854
Hurry and May

00:01:02.563 --> 00:01:04.741
The reasons why one can't
laugh from the heart

00:01:04.765 --> 00:01:06.910
It's a simple reason... that's life

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:11.447
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:15.685
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:15.709 --> 00:01:20.290
