00:01:20.314 --> 00:01:24.427
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:28.965
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:28.989 --> 00:01:34.837
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:39.776
Child is burning

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.759
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:02:14.835 --> 00:02:16.980
There's only one of him, boys...

00:02:17.004 --> 00:02:17.847
Right on!

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.116
But he's no ordinary kid.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.185
And he'll see no mercy today!

00:02:22.209 --> 00:02:23.699
Yeah!

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.196
It looks like the rumors were true, Kido.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:33.696
Yep.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:38.201
But what's going on? Why would one
kid just walk into that? It's suicide.

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:40.557
Try zipping it up, rookie.

00:02:42.229 --> 00:02:45.074
Let's give this kid a beating
his grandkid"s will feel!

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:46.588
Yeah!!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.434
Kitazawa...

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:50.501
Naito, it's you!

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.886
Now, that you're here, we're unbeatable!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:02.314
What's the deal with the big turnout?
All these fellas to fight one measly kid?

00:03:04.985 --> 00:03:08.931
Naito, I thank you for coming, but please
just don't ask any questions, okay...

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:10.184
1 beg you.

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.169
What are you so scared of?

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.820
Please, Naito, no!

00:03:15.529 --> 00:03:17.019
Get up! He's here!

00:03:17.631 --> 00:03:19.497
There... There he is!

00:03:42.756 --> 00:03:43.833
He's alone...

00:03:43.857 --> 00:03:46.349
That punk must think
he's something special.

00:03:47.828 --> 00:03:49.072
Baki!!!

00:03:49.096 --> 00:03:51.240
You afraid to bring
it over that fence?!

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:53.824
Look at him... He's nothing but a runt.

00:04:20.694 --> 00:04:22.321
Naito!

00:04:24.498 --> 00:04:26.057
You'll pay for that!

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:31.468
You think you're so hot? Let's see
how you stand against my blade! Punk!

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.430
Just kidding!

00:04:38.545 --> 00:04:40.570
Kitazawa!

00:04:41.448 --> 00:04:45.261
He's fast... He took down the group
leaders like they were nothing.

00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:48.331
Mentally, he's got more going on
than those who'd resort to things

00:04:48.355 --> 00:04:50.199
like knives and swords...

00:04:50.223 --> 00:04:52.635
And here's the kicker...

00:04:52.659 --> 00:04:56.527
Half of those chumps are ready to split,
but the other half aren't sure.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:02.445
You don't scare us, carrot-top! If you
hadn't noticed, there's a hundred of us.

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:05.097
Against just little old you.

00:05:06.006 --> 00:05:08.985
Why are you laughing at me?!

00:05:09.009 --> 00:05:09.652
Four.

00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:12.455
Speak up if you're talking to me!!

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:14.924
You're only as tough as four men.

00:05:14.948 --> 00:05:16.058
Four? What?

00:05:16.082 --> 00:05:19.211
Four men? What does he mean?

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:30.506
The idiot's gonna fight all of them!

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:31.774
Man, he's tough!

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:33.288
Then let's hit him all at once!

00:05:35.802 --> 00:05:37.133
Morons.

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:41.450
You animal!

00:05:41.474 --> 00:05:43.203
I think you broke my nose!

00:05:43.877 --> 00:05:47.757
He knows that only four people can
come at him at once... Smart kid there.

00:05:47.781 --> 00:05:51.308
There's a hundred of 'em. That twenty
five separate fights. He can't--

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:55.746
Uh, excuse me...

00:06:26.519 --> 00:06:27.953
Now we got him!

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:46.871
<i>He's getting away! After him!</i>

00:07:02.155 --> 00:07:04.634
Kido, shouldn't we try to stop them?

00:07:04.658 --> 00:07:07.270
I got enough false teeth, but thanks.

00:07:07.294 --> 00:07:08.489
Aww, come on!

00:07:21.374 --> 00:07:23.570
Time to shut this party down.

00:07:32.252 --> 00:07:35.244
Alright, ladies... This party's over.

00:07:36.523 --> 00:07:38.218
I'm outta here!

00:07:40.961 --> 00:07:45.194
It's past your bedtime, kid. Get home
before your momma starts worrying.

00:07:45.398 --> 00:07:47.043
You're just going to let them go?

00:07:47.067 --> 00:07:47.693
You're just going to let them go?

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.997
Wake up, Baki.

00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:02.692
Oh, it's just you.

00:08:02.716 --> 00:08:03.793
Kido!

00:08:03.817 --> 00:08:06.843
Don't move! You're under arrest
for assaulting an officer!

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:17.139
Another dentist appointment.

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:20.224
I'm sick of dishing out
money to that bloodsucker.

00:08:23.837 --> 00:08:25.448
Kido, are you okay?

00:08:25.472 --> 00:08:30.052
I'll be fine... Better than these guys.

00:08:30.076 --> 00:08:34.156
Well, Baki, out of a hundred,
it looks like you laid out about...

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:37.693
Thirty-seven of them... Yes...

00:08:37.717 --> 00:08:41.364
Out of an estimated one hundred,
but there could've been more...

00:08:41.388 --> 00:08:44.722
Well... Yes, until the police interviened.

00:08:46.459 --> 00:08:49.292
Good work. Now, go
find the next one.

00:08:56.036 --> 00:08:58.767
A loss is still a loss, Baki.

00:09:03.643 --> 00:09:05.654
Man, only thirty-seven?

00:09:05.678 --> 00:09:07.578
I was really pulling for fifty.

00:09:09.916 --> 00:09:13.147
I thought I was doing them
over pretty good up until the end.

00:09:27.167 --> 00:09:30.713
You sure you wanna let him go?
He did knock out one of your teeth.

00:09:30.737 --> 00:09:33.149
Maybe you wanna lose some teeth, too?

00:09:33.173 --> 00:09:35.384
Just trying to help.

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:36.819
You guys wanna stop following me?

00:09:36.843 --> 00:09:42.491
No can do. Some of those guys might still
be lurking around in some of these shadows.

00:09:42.515 --> 00:09:45.694
Besides, Sly here just joined
up with the Juvenile Division.

00:09:45.718 --> 00:09:47.163
Trying to show him the ropes.

00:09:47.187 --> 00:09:49.432
Learning about you and your
kind is part of the job.

00:09:49.456 --> 00:09:51.424
Yeah, whatever.

00:09:53.726 --> 00:09:55.638
You know, you're a really tough kid.

00:09:55.662 --> 00:09:57.673
Yeah, thanks for noticing.

00:09:57.697 --> 00:10:03.279
Baki here is feared by every low-life punk
in this town. He's somewhat of a legend...

00:10:03.303 --> 00:10:06.273
<i>Don't take my word for it, you'll see.</i>

00:10:12.312 --> 00:10:14.290
"You're dead, Baki!™

00:10:14.314 --> 00:10:16.425
"Die, Bakil!™

00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:18.110
What is all this?

00:10:21.087 --> 00:10:25.801
They know they can't beat him,
so they have to resort to vandalism.

00:10:25.825 --> 00:10:29.138
It's really the only
place they can hit him.

00:10:29.162 --> 00:10:31.140
All this graffiti everywhere.

00:10:31.164 --> 00:10:34.443
Isn't this kind of thing a problem
for the neighborhood, or his parents?

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:37.646
He's here alone. Nobody lives
out here. Not even his parents.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.615
He's doesn't have parents?

00:10:39.639 --> 00:10:42.451
He does, they just don't
live anywhere around here.

00:10:42.475 --> 00:10:44.620
Do you ever stop talking?

00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:46.422
Sorry, kid.

00:10:46.446 --> 00:10:48.346
And pick up your cigarette butts.

00:10:53.987 --> 00:10:57.082
You see what I mean? That's Baki Hanma.

00:10:57.457 --> 00:10:58.100
"Die, Bakil!™

00:10:58.124 --> 00:11:00.469
"Die, Baki!™ If you ever hear of
any kind of fighting in this town,

00:11:00.493 --> 00:11:01.704
"Die, Baki!™ you can be sure
Baki is a part of it somehow.

00:11:01.728 --> 00:11:02.438
You can be sure Baki is
a part of it somehow.

00:11:02.462 --> 00:11:04.640
Nastiest thugs in town are after him,

00:11:04.664 --> 00:11:06.809
the kind of guys that
can break a man in half...

00:11:06.833 --> 00:11:08.777
and Baki's just thirteen years old.

00:11:08.801 --> 00:11:10.064
--Thirteen!?
--Yep.

00:11:27.554 --> 00:11:30.387
Today wouldn't have
taken my dad one minute.

00:11:34.327 --> 00:11:37.353
Like that one time, a long time ago.

00:11:38.998 --> 00:11:40.397
I can't do it.

00:11:41.501 --> 00:11:44.471
I can't ever hope to be
as good as my father.

00:12:24.077 --> 00:12:26.102
We've been expecting you.

00:12:27.947 --> 00:12:29.325
It looks like you've been hurt.

00:12:29.349 --> 00:12:31.078
Just let it go.

00:12:31.551 --> 00:12:35.631
1 hate to tell you this, but you shouldn't
be fighting while you're still training.

00:12:35.655 --> 00:12:37.700
If you want to be a
high-caliber fighter then you--

00:12:37.724 --> 00:12:39.401
Just shut up.

00:12:39.425 --> 00:12:42.538
You're not in the mood... I see.

00:12:42.562 --> 00:12:45.793
Well then, let's just move
right into today's program.

00:12:58.411 --> 00:13:00.489
This boy... is amazing!

00:13:00.513 --> 00:13:07.863
Stronger. I have to get stronger.
If I don't increase my abilities...

00:13:07.887 --> 00:13:11.380
then I'tl never be as powerful as my dad.

00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:14.521
Alright... That's enough.

00:13:18.231 --> 00:13:19.308
Catch your breath, Baki,

00:13:19.332 --> 00:13:22.478
and then we'll move on to the
next activity in today's program.

00:13:22.502 --> 00:13:23.646
No, we won't.

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:25.399
And just what do you mean by that?

00:13:27.807 --> 00:13:30.219
I'm finished with all of
you loud-mouth coaches!

00:13:30.243 --> 00:13:34.390
You're not thinking straight... If you
continue to follow our instructions,

00:13:34.414 --> 00:13:36.246
you're strength could be immeasurable!

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:39.714
Immeasurable strength?

00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:43.632
Baki, stop that!

00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:46.125
Same junk fifty times a day...

00:13:47.393 --> 00:13:50.072
None of it is making me any stronger!

00:13:50.096 --> 00:13:50.739
Hold him tight!

00:13:50.763 --> 00:13:51.407
I am!

00:13:51.431 --> 00:13:52.557
Hold him tighter!!

00:13:53.299 --> 00:13:54.443
This is a waste!

00:13:54.467 --> 00:13:55.944
And so is this!

00:13:55.968 --> 00:13:57.613
It's all worthless!

00:13:57.637 --> 00:13:58.947
Worthless!

00:13:58.971 --> 00:14:04.910
Every second of training is worthless
if I can't beat a measly hundred guys!

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:12.428
I'm done... Done with you guys
once and for all... Got it!?

00:14:12.452 --> 00:14:15.478
From here on out,
I'm gonna do things my way!

00:14:25.264 --> 00:14:31.465
Akezawa residence. How can I help you?
Oh, hello, Coach. Baki did what!?

00:14:41.814 --> 00:14:44.647
Sounds like my boy is outgrowing himself.

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:49.398
Here is the one million as promised.
Please accept our thanks.

00:14:49.422 --> 00:14:54.470
Sorry, but I just don't think one million
is gonna be nearly enough, Kuriyvagawa.

00:14:54.494 --> 00:14:57.657
Almost half of us were left
unconscious and bleeding.

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:05.614
Kitazawa, you were hired to beat Baki,
not to get caught during the process...

00:15:05.638 --> 00:15:10.519
As compensation, I have paid you the price
you agreed upon before you lifted a finger.

00:15:10.543 --> 00:15:11.820
I want more.

00:15:11.844 --> 00:15:15.224
Need I remind you, any physical
damage you may have received

00:15:15.248 --> 00:15:16.925
is irrelevant to our previous agreement.

00:15:16.949 --> 00:15:20.362
Oh, yeah? Then maybe I should take this
up with your bosses at the company.

00:15:20.386 --> 00:15:21.797
How about that?

00:15:21.821 --> 00:15:26.349
See what they say when I tell them that
you hired me to beat up a 13 year old kid.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.052
Well, speak up! I can't hear you!

00:15:31.197 --> 00:15:32.641
Sir, please keep it down!

00:15:32.665 --> 00:15:34.759
Mind your own business!

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.674
You're dead old man! Come here!

00:15:48.981 --> 00:15:51.450
It's rude to point a blade.

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.863
I apologize!

00:15:54.887 --> 00:15:57.754
Well, now, we all make mistakes.

00:16:13.506 --> 00:16:16.385
I want so desperately to get stronger.

00:16:16.409 --> 00:16:20.812
I wanna be the strongest Grappler
in the world, just like my father.

00:16:25.184 --> 00:16:29.018
But I'm never gonna get there
if 1 keep doing the same things.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:36.089
Aw, man... What am I gonna do? I don't
have the brain power to handle this.

00:17:06.425 --> 00:17:07.392
That's the--

00:17:09.795 --> 00:17:12.007
The strongest gangster around?

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:16.812
Now why would the great Akezawa Group
need to know something like that?

00:17:16.836 --> 00:17:20.649
Do you have any idea just how
many of them there are out there?

00:17:20.673 --> 00:17:23.986
Really, I realize how absurd
this must sound to you,

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.954
especially given that you're retired.

00:17:25.978 --> 00:17:28.223
But I was hoping that you
could be giving enough

00:17:28.247 --> 00:17:30.792
to provide me with at
least some assistance.

00:17:30.816 --> 00:17:33.629
Times may have changed,
but if all is working properly,

00:17:33.653 --> 00:17:36.431
this is still a business of aggression.

00:17:36.455 --> 00:17:39.686
We cannot afford a moment of weakness.

00:17:41.761 --> 00:17:43.805
In all the trades of our world,

00:17:43.829 --> 00:17:47.993
there are always one or two who
are considered truly gifted.

00:17:48.701 --> 00:17:51.693
The fighting world is no exception.

00:18:13.259 --> 00:18:16.071
If you want a bare-knuckles fighter...

00:18:16.095 --> 00:18:18.206
You want Kaoru.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.595
Kaoru it is.

00:18:24.236 --> 00:18:25.347
What the--?

00:18:25.371 --> 00:18:28.636
Good one, Dinoy! Show him
what the knee is made of!

00:18:53.466 --> 00:18:55.366
Dinoy! Get up!

00:18:56.969 --> 00:18:59.448
You come here to watch?
'Cause you're a bit young.

00:18:59.472 --> 00:19:02.017
Muay Thai, huh? What's that all about?

00:19:02.041 --> 00:19:04.453
You know? That's cool.

00:19:04.477 --> 00:19:08.590
That's Yuri Chakovsky,
the international welterweight champ.

00:19:08.614 --> 00:19:10.592
Yuri Chakovsky...

00:19:10.616 --> 00:19:14.796
He might just be a welter, but his goal
is to be the undisputed world champion.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:17.666
Only he's so strong, no one
will spar with him anymore...

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:22.471
so he had to bring Thailand's Muay
Thai style champ over to practice.

00:19:22.495 --> 00:19:22.738
However, it doesn't look like
much of a challenge out there.

00:19:22.762 --> 00:19:23.438
--However, it doesn't look like much of a challenge out there.
--Let's go!

00:19:23.462 --> 00:19:26.022
--However, it doesn't look like much of a challenge out there.
--You got him! He's all yours, baby!

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:34.572
That's it, Dinoy!
Don't forget to use your legs!

00:19:40.713 --> 00:19:44.726
Kaoru Hanayama is the current
boss of the Hanayama gang...

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:48.497
He inheirited the leadership of the group
when his father, the previous leader,

00:19:48.521 --> 00:19:51.433
died under questionable circumstances.

00:19:51.457 --> 00:19:54.836
Upon his ascension, Kaoru
started a vengeance war

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:58.774
with Kobe's vicious Tomizawa Group.

00:19:58.798 --> 00:20:02.377
He began this war by
using only his bare hands

00:20:02.401 --> 00:20:07.339
to destroy the Tomizawa Group's
armed faction of over fifty men.

00:20:07.606 --> 00:20:09.438
Impressive.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:19.327
Thirty minutes was all it took
for this fifteen year old boy

00:20:19.351 --> 00:20:23.532
to obliterate an entire gang of men
with decades more fighting experience.

00:20:23.556 --> 00:20:25.388
He's fifteen?

00:20:26.492 --> 00:20:31.589
Kaoru visited here two years ago and
left that behind as a souvenir for me.

00:20:33.432 --> 00:20:37.528
He is truly a gifted young man.

00:20:40.773 --> 00:20:42.434
Bring on the pain!!

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:51.478
What an uppercut! I didn't
even see that one coming.

00:20:58.758 --> 00:21:00.248
He's quick.

00:21:11.971 --> 00:21:13.782
That had to hurt.

00:21:13.806 --> 00:21:15.205
It's over.

00:21:15.808 --> 00:21:18.505
Dinoy! Wake up! Dinoy!

00:21:22.815 --> 00:21:26.718
Nice job, Yuri... Now, on to
the next program, I think.

00:21:30.189 --> 00:21:32.283
Now, who is that young lad?

00:21:36.395 --> 00:21:37.863
He's not bad...

00:21:53.245 --> 00:21:56.340
Yuri Chakovsky, if I'm not mistaken.

00:21:59.585 --> 00:22:02.919
Think you can go a few more rounds?

00:22:46.265 --> 00:22:51.813
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:51.837 --> 00:22:57.419
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:57.443 --> 00:23:03.091
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:03.115 --> 00:23:08.096
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:13.635
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:13.659 --> 00:23:19.174
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:19.198 --> 00:23:24.846
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:30.385
but they will be reborn

00:23:30.409 --> 00:23:36.057
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:36.081 --> 00:23:42.020
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:56.101 --> 00:24:00.181
To fulfill the ideology of
such classic ideals as these,

00:24:00.205 --> 00:24:04.219
Baki himself has drawn battie
lines that he has had to cross.

00:24:04.243 --> 00:24:09.658
But this inner awakening has also set
free a surrounding darkness in the world.

00:24:09.682 --> 00:24:16.364
And it is this ferocious fang that Baki
the Grappler will have to face, alone.

00:24:16.388 --> 00:24:18.379
On the next episode.
